**Profile**: Title: Vault Underground, Origin: Rinascita.

{{Intro/Location|Vault Underground}} 
Tucked beneath the Sea of Clouds lies a vast depository zone of the Averardo Vault. Each item moved to the Vault will be meticulously transported to its designated storage location, where it will be safeguarded with the utmost care and precision.

